  <section class="sec" id="approche">
    <div class="wrap approach">
      <div class="approach-copy reveal">
        <div class="slabel">Our approach</div>
        <h2>A commitment that is both<br><span class="grad">human and sustainable.</span></h2>
        <p>ImiziLinks acts where the skills exist but the network is missing. Qualified people, often multilingual, trained in France or abroad, stay on the edge of the job market for lack of contacts, bearings and codes.</p>
        <p>We build that bridge — and we chose not to stop there. <strong>Every partnership with a company comes with a traceable environmental contribution</strong>, run with Tree-Nation. Because a credible social commitment in 2026 is thought through with the environment, not alongside it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-visual reveal">
        <img src="/img/notre-impact-communaute.jpg" alt="ImiziLinks community members gathered around a shared project" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

