  <section class="sec" id="impact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center reveal">
        <div class="slabel">Our dual impact</div>
        <h2>A <span class="grad">social</span><br>and <span class="grad-eco">environmental</span> impact.</h2>
        <p>Two dimensions rarely brought together in a single non-profit partnership — and that is precisely what makes ours valuable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="duo reveal">
        <div class="duo-card social">
          <small>Social side</small>
          <h3>Opening access to employment</h3>
          <p>We support qualified, motivated people held back not by their skills but by a lack of network and unfamiliarity with the codes of the French job market.</p>
          <div class="duo-list">
            <div class="duo-item"><span class="tick">✓</span><p>A community member welcomed for an internship, apprenticeship or role at your company, with our support before and after they arrive.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><span class="tick">✓</span><p>Your offers relayed to a targeted and prepared community.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><span class="tick">✓</span><p>Your staff involved in mentoring and career workshops.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="duo-card eco">
          <small>Environmental side</small>
          <h3>Plant, track, share</h3>
          <p>Every partnership comes with an environmental contribution run with Tree-Nation: a planted, traceable tree for every action defined together.</p>
          <div class="duo-list">
            <div class="duo-item"><span class="tick">✓</span><p>A planting funded and managed by ImiziLinks.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><span class="tick">✓</span><p>A tree tied to a concrete social step forward: a partnership or a hire.</p></div>
            <div class="duo-item"><span class="tick">✓</span><p>A public forest, identifiable projects and accessible planting certificates.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="duo-badge">🌱 Tree-Nation partnership being set up</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

