        <div class="eco-mini">
          <div class="eco-mini-row"><span class="dot">✓</span><p><strong>A tree to mark a step forward</strong>: a partnership signed, a hire made or an important milestone for the community.</p></div>
          <div class="eco-mini-row"><span class="dot">✓</span><p><strong>Tracked plantings</strong>: each tree is linked to a reforestation project you can view in the ImiziLinks Tree-Nation forest.</p></div>
          <div class="eco-mini-row"><span class="dot">✓</span><p><strong>Shared proof of impact</strong>: we publish the number of trees actually planted and the associated certificates, within the limit of our available budget.</p></div>
